<title>USA: Ticketmaster, Disney in 4-yr pact.</title>
<headline>Ticketmaster, Disney in 4-yr pact.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ticketmaster Group Inc said Tuesday it entered into a four-year ticket provider agreement with affiliates and subsidiaries of the Walt Disney Co.  </p>
<p>Ticketmaster said in a release that it will be the exclusive off-site ticketing company for Disney sports teams and facilities, as well as select Disney theaters.</p>
<p>The agreement covers ticketing through telephone call centers nationwide, retail ticket center outlets and the Internet, Ticketmaster added.</p>
</text>
